        "created_at": "2020-04-21T05:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Technically, to remove Boost&nbsp;mods (in this case, the sniper bots' cover), shouldn't a Hinder action be taken instead?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Regardless, if we were to go back to my initial example, could Utility-mode&nbsp;Bunker have used the overcome action to stop the spider bots in their tracks (but not damaging them) by having a heap of rubble fall on them?</p>",
