        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-21T13:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It depends on the situation setup. &nbsp;There are some global hinders that when applied say an overcome can be done to remove it. &nbsp; In the case of Spider Bots individually applying Boosts then a Hinder action would be needed to negate any bonuses. &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As to your second question in this scenario it does describe they can be removed as a threat&nbsp;through an Overcome. &nbsp; Though honestly they'd need to describe&nbsp;taking out their perch without a weapon&nbsp;instead of having rocks fall on them as the description of where they are don't quite support having rocks fall on them. &nbsp; In most cases though Bunker in Utility Mode would not be able to do much about them as he would need&nbsp;to attack to take out the minions. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:17.506Z",
